MSTA-Mamba was developed from research code that originated from
https://github.com/lxztju/pytorch_classification (MIT License, copyright
xiangzhe_lu). The release implementation has been reorganized and rewritten
around the architecture described in the accompanying BIBM paper.

MambaVision is a separate NVIDIA project. Users are responsible for complying
with its code and pretrained-weight license. EchoNet-Dynamic is distributed
under its own data-use terms and is not included in this repository.

